    {
      "source": "Conversions from String to any type will typically use the <code>setAsText</code>\nmethod of the PropertyEditor class, or a Spring Converter in a ConversionService.",
      "translation": "从 String 到任何类型的转换通常使用 `PropertyEditor` 类的 `<code>setAsText</code>` 方法，或者在 `ConversionService` 中的 Spring Converter。",
      "count": 4
    },
    {
      "source": "Convert the value to the required type (if necessary from a String).",
      "translation": "将值转换为所需的类型（如有必要，从字符串转换）。",
      "count": 4
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>requiredType</code> - the type we must convert to\n(or <code>null</code> if not known, for example in case of a collection element)",
      "translation": "<code>requiredType</code> - 必须转换的目标类型（或为 <code>null</code>，例如在集合元素的情况下未知）",
      "count": 4
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a href=\"TypeMismatchException.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.beans\">TypeMismatchException</a></code> - if type conversion failed",
      "translation": "<code><a href=\"TypeMismatchException.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.beans\">TypeMismatchException</a></code> - 如果类型转换失败",
      "count": 4
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>value</code> - the value to convert",
      "translation": "<code>value</code> - 要转换的值",
      "count": 4
    },
    {
